    "title": "Special Marine Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2025-08-28 00:12:00 EDT Expires: 2025-08-28 01:15:00 EDT Urgency: Immediate Severity: Severe Certainty: Likely Instruction: Move to safe harbor until hazardous weather passes. Target Area: Grand Traverse Bay south of a line Grand Traverse Light to Norwood MI SMWAPX\nThe National Weather Service in Gaylord has issued a\n* Special Marine Warning for... Grand Traverse Bay...\n* Until 115 AM EDT.\n* At 1212 AM EDT, strong thunderstorms were located along a line extending from near Old Mission Lighthouse to near Glen Arbor, moving east at 30 knots.\nHAZARD...Wind gusts to 40 knots.\nSOURCE...Radar.\nIMPACT...Small craft could be damaged in briefly higher winds and suddenly higher waves.\n* Locations impacted include... Old Mission Lighthouse, Suttons Bay, Traverse City, and Elk Rapids.",
